ORIGIN

This skill is original work. It was developed in September 2026 while building Jev
question batteries for legal classification tasks, including a classifier for felony
murder under the Texas Penal Code and a battery on federal standing and justiciability,
and was revised after running those batteries against case vignettes on jev-1.13.

The skill summarizes Jev's documented behavior and known weaknesses from TypeSafe's
public documentation (https://docs.typesafe.ai). That summary is a paraphrase as of
September 2026. Jev and TypeSafe are products of TypeSafe AI.

This skill is not affiliated with, or endorsed by, TypeSafe AI or Lawve.

